5,1,1,talk,Minako,,The informal habit has failed. We need a system that accounts for actual time spent. I want to know the real hours involved before we commit.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. But time is only half the story. I suspect the workload isn't distributed evenly based on who actually uses the spaces.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I just want to stop guessing! The bathroom scares me, and the kitchen is a mystery. Can we make it predictable?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the small costs, like bleach and sponges, that slip through the cracks. Who pays for those?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I care less about the rooms than about us. I want a system that keeps us speaking kindly to each other a year from now.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, your point about usage is valid. But we need hard data on the hours first. I will look into the stopwatch timing and the house chat rows.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, fair enough. I’ll check the wall calendar absences and the fortnight’s kitchen watch to see who’s actually here and using the space.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I’m picking the bathroom grout mystery and what everyone thinks is ""done""! I want to know why it gets so gross so fast.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I’ll check the spray receipts and the management office rate sheet. I need to see exactly what these supplies cost us each month.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I will examine the previous tenants' note and the recorded rows in the house chat. I want to understand how past arrangements affected our relationships.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
