35,2,1,talk,Minako,,The timing shows one hundred and two minutes per pass. The chat logs show both rows started with reminders. We need a system that prevents those reminders.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The calendar shows two of us away weekly, one gone all August. The kitchen watch proves three people create the mess. Usage and absence are wildly uneven.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako, one hundred and two minutes? That’s almost two hours! @Benjamin, if only three people cook, why do I have to clean?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Minako, one hundred and two minutes is significant. @Benjamin, uneven usage is clear. I found supplies cost 2,300 yen monthly, often bought twice.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, the reminders are the true cost. @Benjamin, the previous tenants’ silence warns us. We must choose a path that preserves our voices, not just the rooms.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, your data confirms the imbalance. @Shizue, the duplicate purchases are a waste. We need a structure that accounts for both time and usage.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, precisely. The data confirms my suspicion. We cannot treat absent members as equal contributors. The system must reflect actual presence and usage, or it will fail.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Benjamin, that makes me feel a little better! But @Minako, two hours is scary. I found the grout gets black in eleven days because the window is tiny.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, the management office charges 4,200 yen an hour, billed to one person. That is steep. @Sakura, eleven days is quick. We must plan carefully.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, the previous tenants’ silence is a warning. If we assign permanent rooms, we risk the same isolation. We must choose a path that keeps us speaking, not just cleaning.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the data is clear. @Shizue, the 4,200 yen rate is high, but 102 minutes of labor is real. We must weigh cost against time.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, cost is secondary to fairness. If three people create the mess, they should bear the burden. I reject any system that ignores this disparity.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
